<.page_shell>
  <section class="relative pt-16 pb-14 pl-10 sm:pl-12 lg:pt-20 lg:pl-48">
    <p class="text-ink/55 text-label mb-6 font-semibold uppercase lg:absolute lg:top-20 lg:left-0 lg:mb-0 lg:w-32 lg:text-right">
      Privacy
    </p>

    <h1 class="font-display text-hero max-w-3xl font-normal">Request data deletion</h1>
    <p class="text-fine text-ink/55 mt-4">Last updated 31 July 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-8">
      <p class="text-body text-ink/75 font-light">
        You can ask Nila, operated by Kaguya Media Private Limited, to delete or
        anonymise personal data associated with you or your business. This
        includes eligible account details, WhatsApp communications and metadata,
        uploaded documents, and records derived from them.
      </p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h4 font-normal">How to make a request</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-ink/75 mt-3 font-light">
          Email
          <a
            href="mailto:privacy@nila.tax?subject=Data%20deletion%20request"
            class="text-redink hover:underline"
          >privacy@nila.tax</a>
          from your registered business email with the subject “Data deletion
          request”. Include your name, company or firm name, registered email,
          and the phone number associated with the WhatsApp communications you
          want deleted. Do not send identity documents unless we ask for them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h4 font-normal">What happens next</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-ink/75 mt-3 font-light">
          We will acknowledge the request, verify that you are authorised to make
          it, and identify the relevant data. We will then delete or anonymise
          eligible data and confirm when the request is complete. If the data
          belongs to one of our customers' clients, we may coordinate with that
          customer before acting on the request.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h4 font-normal">Data we may retain</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-ink/75 mt-3 font-light">
          Some records may be retained where required by legal and regulatory
          retention requirements, to establish or defend legal claims, prevent
          fraud or abuse, or preserve necessary security and audit records. We
          restrict retained data to those purposes and delete it when the
          applicable retention period ends. Residual copies in protected backups
          expire through the normal backup lifecycle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-h4 font-normal">Questions</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-ink/75 mt-3 font-light">
          For questions about deletion or any other privacy right, contact <a
            href="mailto:privacy@nila.tax"
            class="text-redink hover:underline"
          >privacy@nila.tax</a>.
          Our broader handling practices are described in the <.link
            navigate={~p"/privacy"}
            class="text-redink hover:underline"
          >privacy policy</.link>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</.page_shell>
